Bilkul 👍 OSI Model ko Hinglish mein easy way mein samjho. Ye networking ka 7-layer framework hai. Agar tum TryHackMe kar rahe ho, to OSI layers ko yaad rakhna bahut important hai.

🌐 OSI Model kya hai?

OSI = Open Systems Interconnection

Simple words mein:

OSI Model batata hai ki network par data ek device se doosre device tak kaise travel karta hai.

Ismein total 7 layers hain:

7 → Application
6 → Presentation
5 → Session
4 → Transport
3 → Network
2 → Data Link
1 → Physical

Ek easy trick:

A P S T N D P

Yaad karne ke liye:

All People Seem To Need Data Processing

📦 Encapsulation kya hai?

Jab data sender se receiver ki taraf jaata hai, har OSI layer apni required information/data add karti hai.

Is process ko encapsulation kehte hain.

Simple example:

Application
    ↓
Presentation
    ↓
Session
    ↓
Transport
    ↓
Network
    ↓
Data Link
    ↓
Physical
    ↓
💻 Network


Receiver side par reverse process hota hai:

Physical
    ↓
Data Link
    ↓
Network
    ↓
Transport
    ↓
Session
    ↓
Presentation
    ↓
Application

Layer 1 — Physical 🔌

Physical Layer = actual physical hardware.

Yahan actual bits (0 aur 1) electrical/electromagnetic/physical signals ke form mein travel karte hain.

Examples:

Ethernet cable
Network cable
Electrical signals
Physical connectors
Computer ===== Ethernet Cable ===== Computer
              0s and 1s

Yaad rakho:

Layer 1 = Wire + Signals + Bits

Layer 2 — Data Link 🔗

Layer 2 ka main focus hai MAC addresses aur local network communication.

Yahan MAC address important hai.

Example:

IP  → 192.168.1.100
MAC → AA:BB:CC:11:22:33


Layer 2 data ko transmission ke suitable format mein bhi prepare karta hai.

Device example:

Switch primarily Layer 2 par operate karta hai.

Yaad rakho:

Layer 2 = MAC Address

